MASTER RECREATION PROMPT:
-------------------------
Build the complete "KISHSASHI URBANCHIC" Luxury Men’s & Women’s Fashion E-Commerce Platform using React 19, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS v4, Lucide React icons, and a 100% complete embedded SQLite3 database engine (Zero external dependencies).

Key Brand & Storefront Specifications:
- Brand Name: KISHSASHI URBANCHIC
- Compulsory Access Control: When the website runs, login and password authentication are mandatory/compulsory before accessing the storefront, with convenient 1-click test credentials available.
- Out of Stock Handling: Once a product is out of stock (stock <= 0), attempting to click or view the product immediately navigates back to the Home Dashboard with a prominent notification banner.
- Top Announcement: "✦ MODERN GRACE, URBAN STYLE ✦"
- Logo Image: High-resolution transparent background emblem bundled via Vite asset pipeline and static fallbacks (/assets/logo.jpeg), rendered at 68px height (+20px increase) in navbar, footer, admin banner, and login dialog.
- Currency: LKR (e.g., LKR 14,500) across all product cards, detail pages, shopping bags, wishlists, checkout views, invoices, user dashboard, and admin portal.
- Flagship Showroom & Contact Info:
  - Address: No. 22 Madampitiya Road, Colombo 15
  - Landmark: Near Modara Police station
  - Mobile Number: +94 753764932
  - Email: info.kishsashi@gmail.com
- Aesthetic & Palette:
  - Deep Luxury Green (#072A1E / #051F16), Metallic Gold (#D4AF37 / #F3E5AB), Warm Ivory (#FBF9F5)
  - Typography: Playfair Display (serif headings), Inter (sans body), JetBrains Mono (mono tags/prices/badges)
- Database Architecture:
  - SQLite3 Embedded Database Engine (`kishsashi.db`) - Zero cloud dependency, no AWS RDS required, local file-based persistent storage with full ACID compliance.
  - Python Provisioner & Integrity Verifier (`sqlite-backend/seed_db.py`).
  - Python REST API Engine (`sqlite-backend/app.py`) with native `sqlite3` driver and auto-seeding DDL (`schema.sql`).
- Core Features Included:
  1. Storefront View:
     - Top announcement bar ("✦ MODERN GRACE, URBAN STYLE ✦"), transparent brand logo emblem in navbar & browser favicon, dynamic category navbar ("Kurtis Set", Sarees, Dresses, etc.), search bar, role switcher.
     - Out of stock auto-redirection: Products with 0 stock return directly to the Home Dashboard with notice.
     - Hero Banner Slider with promotional CTAs.
     - Dynamic category tabs, discount filter banners, price/color/size/stock filters, and sorting.
     - Product Cards with hover image swap, discount badge, stock status badge, wishlist heart toggle, and quick Add to Bag.
     - Product Detail Modal/Page with image gallery, zoom preview, size/color selectors, live stock validation, "Add to Bag", and "Buy It Now".
     - Slide-over Shopping Bag Drawer & Wishlist Drawer with real-time stock enforcement.
     - Multi-step / Modal Checkout with saved address selection or new delivery address form, Cash on Delivery (COD) & Bank Transfer support, and Printable Official Invoice Receipt.
  2. Customer Dashboard View (UserDashboardView):
     - Order history with status tracking, invoice download/print, and order cancellation (restores stock).
     - Saved delivery addresses management (Add, Edit, Set Default, Delete).
     - Customer Profile edit (Avatar upload via file or URL, phone, address).
  3. Admin Portal (AdminPortalView):
     - Product Catalog CRUD: Add new products with multiple images, category/subcategory, sizes, colors, MRP, discount price in LKR, live stock tracking.
     - Category Management (Add, Edit, Delete categories including Kurtis Set, Sarees, Dresses, etc.).
     - Order Management: View incoming orders, change fulfillment statuses (Pending -> Confirmed -> Packed -> Shipped -> Delivered -> Cancelled), print packing slips.
     - Dynamic Navbar Editor (reorder, rename, toggle links).
     - Promotional Banner Slider Manager (Add, edit images, captions, CTAs).
     - Customer Review Moderation.
     - Delivery Settings (Customizable shipping fee in LKR).
  4. Backend Architecture:
     - Python REST API with SQLite3 persistent storage, auto-init schema, seed scripts, and full CRUD endpoints.

